{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1tWEUvyWvokuj9npBPi", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I did not sign off. I found no bug the developer accepted, but I couldn't finish the sweep cleanly.\n\n**What I tested**\n- **Shop bulk sales:** Sell Junk and Sell Old Gear previews, with the \"Keep one of each item\" toggle both off and on. Totals matched their rows in every case. Two real sales matched their previews and toasts: Sell Junk for 486 and Sell Old Gear for 87. Recent bulk sales listed them correctly.\n- **Per-item sell panel:** Quantity presets, Max and +/- behaved consistently. A single sale of one Iron Sword for 62 coins reduced the count correctly.\n- **Gear:** Combat stat totals checked out by hand. The slot chooser ordering (by requirement, then title) was correct for Head, Body and Cape. Equip Best Gear picked sensible items and DEF totals added up. I restored all slots afterward. Rotating to landscape and back kept state.\n- **Armory and Bestiary:** The obtained count matched its progress bar. The Attack and Strength sorts were descending. By Location grouped entries correctly.\n\n**Reports filed (5, all came back \"could not reproduce\")**\n1. Sell Old Gear / per-item panel keeps one copy of equipped gear regardless of the toggle.\n2. Bosses tab header reads \"0 / 100 encountered\".\n3. Bronze Boots row sometimes shows no \"×1 in inventory\" in the Shop Sell list.\n4. Single equipped Iron Sword vs single Bronze Dagger sell differently.\n5. Buy Logs Max overshoots coins. **This one was my mistake.** My arithmetic left out the 62 coins from the Iron Sword sale. With the sale included, coins were 2,568,438, and floor(2,568,438 / 7) = 366,919 is correct. The developer's rejection was right.\n\n**Gaps that keep me from signing off**\n- Swipes stopped scrolling in the Bestiary, Armory and Quests lists (and once in the Shop Buy list), so I could not see the rest of the enemy list, the Missing count, or whether Void Archon sits under Abyssal Throne in By Location.\n- I did not test the Bestiary's encounter count, which depends on combat.\n\n**State changes from testing (not restored)**\n- Sold Cowhide ×14, Feather ×60, Wool ×7 (Sell Junk, 486 coins).\n- Sold Iron Sword ×2 and Bronze Axe ×1 (62 + 62 + 25 + 87 bulk and per-item; net Iron Sword now ×1, Bronze Axe now ×1).\n- Coins rose by 635 in total (486 + 62 + 87) from the 2,567,890 starting balance.\n- Keep-one toggle and sort are back to off/Default. Equipment was restored to the starting slots."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1933, "cache_read_input_tokens": 300595, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1933}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a7c4c4d5-8d5d-4026-960a-56054eace5c6", "uuid": "f1b88819-f233-4ad1-b692-32391a820302", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T00:39:58.486Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1tWEEo4xNozCFPuzyNz"}
